---
import { referralEmailAddress, referralEmailUrl } from "../lib/site";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="Design variation: dark terminal." />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0c0f0c" />
    <title>V2 Terminal | Modern Faber</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
    <style is:global>
      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      html {
        background: #0c0f0c;
      }

      body {
        min-height: 100vh;
        padding: 40px;
        color: #c9d1c9;
        background: #0c0f0c;
        font-family: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, "Cascadia Mono",
          Consolas, "Liberation Mono", monospace;
        font-size: 13px;
        line-height: 22px;
      }

      main {
        display: grid;
        gap: 22px;
        justify-items: start;
      }

      .prompt {
        color: #4ade80;
      }

      .cmd {
        color: #e8ede8;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: inherit;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #e8ede8;
      }

      .out {
        max-width: 72ch;
        color: #a8b3a8;
      }

      .out strong {
        color: #e8ede8;
        font-weight: 400;
      }

      a {
        color: #4ade80;
        text-decoration: underline;
        text-underline-offset: 3px;
      }

      .cursor {
        display: inline-block;
        width: 0.6em;
        height: 1em;
        vertical-align: text-bottom;
        background: #4ade80;
        animation: blink 1s step-end infinite;
      }

      @keyframes blink {
        50% {
          opacity: 0;
        }
      }

      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        .cursor {
          animation: none;
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 600px) {
        body {
          padding: 20px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <h1><span class="prompt">~</span> modern-faber</h1>

      <p><span class="prompt">$</span> <span class="cmd">cat letter.txt</span></p>

      <p class="out">
        Faber is an old word for a maker &mdash; the smith at the forge, the carpenter at the
        bench, the hand that shapes raw material into something that did not exist before.
        <strong><em>Homo faber</em>: the one who makes.</strong> There have never been fewer.
        Not because people stopped wanting to make things, but because talking about making
        became easier than making &mdash; the feed rewards the announcement, not the object,
        and whole rooms fill with people circling the work they say they want to do.
      </p>

      <p class="out">
        Modern Faber is a room for the ones who still make. One rule holds it together:
        <strong>come back every week with something real, and say what you changed.</strong>
        There is no audience here, no applause &mdash; only other fabers paying attention to
        the details you almost skipped. That attention costs something. It is meant to. Keep
        the rhythm long enough and you are left with a body of work, a sharper eye, and the
        few people you actually want beside you at the bench.
      </p>

      <p>
        <span class="prompt">$</span> <span class="cmd">join</span><br />
        <span class="out">&rarr; permission denied: referral required</span><br />
        <span class="out">&rarr; a faber vouches for you at <a href={referralEmailUrl}>{referralEmailAddress}</a></span>
      </p>

      <p><span class="prompt">$</span> <span class="cursor" aria-hidden="true"></span></p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
